{{!
    @template tool_vae/journal_page

    The page "Journal réflexif", below its heading: the two notes (the journal is private; name nobody in it), what the
    journal is, the notice when it is closed, the button to start an entry (or the notification that the journal is full),
    one sentence when there is no entry or the table of the entries, and the way back to the dossier.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\journal_page. The template holds no logic. Every
    text and address is escaped (double braces), except three keys of HTML (triple braces): closedhtml, a notification made
    by the core ($output->notification()); starthtml, the button to start an entry ($output->single_button()) or the
    notification that the journal is full; tablehtml, a table drawn by the template tool_vae/table (its texts and links are
    escaped by the template tool_vae/cell_content).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * private - string, the note that the journal is private
    * consigne - string, the note to name nobody in it
    * intro - string, what the journal is
    * closedhtml - false, or HTML: the notice that the journal is closed
    * starthtml - false, or HTML: the button to start an entry, or the notification that the journal is full
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence drawn when there is no entry
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table of the entries
    * back - {url, label}: the way back to the dossier

    Example context (json):
    {
        "private": "This journal is yours: nobody else reads it.",
        "consigne": "Name nobody in it.",
        "intro": "Write here what you learn as you go.",
        "closedhtml": false,
        "starthtml": "<div class=\"singlebutton\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">New entry</button></div>",
        "none": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable tool-vae-journal\"><tbody><tr><td>Entry 1</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php", "label": "Back to the dossier"}
    }
}}
<div class="alert alert-info tool-vae-labelling" role="note">{{private}}</div>
<div class="alert alert-warning tool-vae-anonymise" role="note">{{consigne}}</div>
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#closedhtml}}
{{{closedhtml}}}
{{/closedhtml}}
{{#starthtml}}
{{{starthtml}}}
{{/starthtml}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{none}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#back}}
<p><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></p>
{{/back}}
